  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: localized UI - English and Arabic built in, follows the host's UI culture (RTL supported); hosts override texts or add languages with UseTexts<T>() / UseTextsFrom<TResource>(); errors carry stable codes (MaskingException / MaskingFormatException, MaskingErrorCodes) that the backend API returns so remote UIs can translate them. 1.2.1:UI renders inside the host layout/theme in any render mode (Server, WebAssembly, static + islands); StingrayDbMasking.AspNetCore replaces .Api; user-token auth for WebAssembly UIs. 1.2.0: backend/frontend split - StingrayDbMasking.Api (MapStingrayDbMaskingApi) + UseRemoteServer(...) so connection strings stay on the backend; EF Core migrations for the profile store are applied automatically.",
